### AETHERIA — V11: Complete Animation, Movement & Character Presentation System

V11 upgrades how every character, creature, enemy, companion, and mount moves, reacts, performs actions, and communicates visually.

V10 focused on the world map, geography, terrain, and world streaming. V11 builds on that foundation by making the world feel physically alive through responsive movement, believable animation, advanced character controllers, procedural motion, and cinematic presentation.

This is a strictly single-player system.

