### 8\. Animation quality and performance

Animation quality should scale according to distance and gameplay importance.

| Distance / importance        | Animation behavior                 |
| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Immediate player interaction | Full animation quality             |
| Nearby characters            | Full or reduced procedural quality |
| Medium distance              | Reduced update frequency           |
| Far distance                 | Simplified animation               |
| Outside simulation range     | Suspend unnecessary animation      |

Do not use distance alone: an important boss, quest NPC, or visible companion may need higher quality even when farther away.

### Performance requirements

* Reuse compatible animation controllers.

* Avoid unnecessary Animator updates.

* Reduce expensive IK calculations at distance.

* Use appropriate skeletal LOD.

* Pool temporary animation effects.

* Profile CPU and GPU animation costs separately.

* Preserve correct animation behavior during world streaming.

